<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>My Integrated Work Dashboard</title>
<style>
*{box-sizing:border-box}
body{margin:0;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;background:#f3f5f9;color:#172033}
header{background:#142c4e;color:white;padding:24px 20px}
header h2{margin:0 0 7px}
header p{margin:0;color:#cbd5e1;font-size:13px}
main{padding:20px;max-width:900px;margin:auto}
h3{margin-top:25px}
.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:12px}
.card{background:white;padding:18px;border-radius:13px;border:1px solid #e4e8ef}
.card strong{display:block;margin:10px 0 6px}
.card p{font-size:12px;color:#64748b;margin:0}
.status{font-size:11px;color:#b7791f}
.icon{font-size:25px}
.welcome{background:white;padding:18px;border-radius:13px}
footer{text-align:center;color:#94a3b8;font-size:11px;padding:25px}
@media(max-width:400px){.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<header>
<h2>My Work Dashboard</h2>
<p>Personal Integrated Monitoring System</p>
</header>
<main>
<section class="welcome">
<strong>Selamat datang!</strong>
<p>One place to monitor your work systems.</p>
</section>

<h3>Monitoring Systems</h3>
<section class="grid">
<div class="card">
<div class="icon">👥</div>
<strong>HRIS SmartHC</strong>
<p>Data karyawan, kehadiran, cuti, lembur dan kompetensi.</p>
<br><span class="status">● Belum terhubung</span>
</div>
<div class="card">
<div class="icon">🏗️</div>
<strong>E-Workshop</strong>
<p>Monitoring scaffolding dan heavy equipment.</p>
<br><span class="status">● Belum terhubung</span>
</div>
<div class="card">
<div class="icon">📊</div>
<strong>Excel Monitoring MA-4</strong>
<p>Progress pekerjaan, kontrak dan evaluasi.</p>
<br><span class="status">● Belum terhubung</span>
</div>
<div class="card">
<div class="icon">🌐</div>
<strong>Other Websites</strong>
<p>Integrasi website perusahaan lainnya.</p>
<br><span class="status">● Belum terhubung</span>
</div>
</section>

<h3>System Information</h3>
<div class="card">
<strong>Dashboard Version 1.0</strong>
<p>Mode: Prototype</p>
<p>Data: Demonstration only</p>
<p>Automatic synchronization: Not configured</p>
</div>
</main>
<footer>My Integrated Work Dashboard © 2026</footer>
</body>
</html>
